  "acceptance": [
    "Profiles declare trigger evidence, applicability, required observations, counterexamples, completion evidence and rollback without embedding task IDs, vendors or repository paths in control flow.",
    "Expand-contract activates only for broad contract migrations and requires an expand step, independently green migration batches, an old-form usage query and a zero-caller contract gate.",
    "TDD oracle fidelity proves expected values come from an independent source and flags private-method, internal-mock and tautological tests.",
    "Review smells remain replaceable heuristics beneath repository standards; Standards and Spec findings remain separate TASK-SKL-0021 axes.",
    "Merge-conflict guidance records both-side intent provenance and may fail closed or abort safely when goals conflict; it never mandates ours/theirs.",
    "Existing `atm-plan-authoring`, `atm-task-card-authoring`, `atm-evidence` and deep-module routes consume profiles without creating a parallel lifecycle or registry."
  ],
